To fast travel, you must first walk to a fast-travel point, and your bed is never a travel target: after a long trip, you walk home. With this mod, open the map (M) anywhere, click an unlocked fast-travel point or your bed, and confirm.

[size=4][b]Main features[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Fast travel[/b]: the map (M) shows your unlocked fast-travel points, the same as the map of a fast-travel point. Click one to open the game's travel window, then confirm. Locked points stay locked.[/*]
[*][b]Bed travel[/b]: click your claimed bed on the map to travel to it.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Save safety[/b][/size]
The mod stores nothing in your save, so you can remove it at any time.

[size=4][b]Multiplayer[/b][/size]
Tested only in single player. Each player can install it or not: it changes only your own map. A player with the mod can travel also when the host does not have it. In co-op, the bed travel of a client can do nothing when the bed is far away.

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Permafrost (Early Access), the update of 30 October 2026 or later.[/*]
[*][url=https://github.com/UE4SS-RE/RE-UE4SS/releases]UE4SS[/url] 3.0.1 or later. Vortex installs it for you.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[b]Vortex (recommended):[/b]
[list=1]
[*]Click [b]Vortex[/b] at the top of this page [i](needs the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/site/mods/2466]Permafrost Vortex Extension[/url], which also installs UE4SS)[/i].[/*][/list]

[b]Manual installation:[/b]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://github.com/UE4SS-RE/RE-UE4SS/releases]UE4SS[/url].[/*]
[*]Extract this mod's zip into the game folder (the folder with Permafrost.exe). The mod lands in Permafrost\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods. Full path example:
[code]C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\Permafrost\Permafrost\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods\FastTravelFromMap[/code][/*][/list]

[size=4][b]Uninstall[/b][/size]
In Vortex, remove the mod on the Mods page. After a manual install, delete the [font=Courier New]FastTravelFromMap[/font] folder from the [font=Courier New]ue4ss\Mods[/font] folder.

[size=4][b]Configuration[/b][/size]
To change mod settings, edit [font=Courier New]ue4ss\Mods\FastTravelFromMap\config.lua[/font] while the game is closed (see [url=https://github.com/ivmakk-pf/pf-fast-travel-from-map/blob/main/CONFIG.md]CONFIG.md[/url] for every setting). Changes apply at the next game start.

